{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/a3e3323bd45c9a2ffe7fe79585cebd26.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1200 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/38e9518071943a91dbeb155eb4cb477f.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/7344c07b78e415d02e8f11c3d1b82c5f.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9650c11352d4f67c6687bd29838abfcf.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.\u00a0Yum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/740daad8a97062c4fea0695a05ec3233.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to throw hands with the gods themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/80cb2fb6ade9d8a9d610deabf646a9af.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1200 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823480?t=1763559788","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/a37b66633a76abcdb043e046d6e9498a7c95445b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763559788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/2ae58f2ab4fccf268afd448c82ddcb719f8b037d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763559788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/2ae58f2ab4fccf268afd448c82ddcb719f8b037d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763559788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3839270,"description":""},{"appid":3839270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/a3e3323bd45c9a2ffe7fe79585cebd26.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1200 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/38e9518071943a91dbeb155eb4cb477f.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/7344c07b78e415d02e8f11c3d1b82c5f.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/c5fee776fbd85c573db66e73089de395.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9650c11352d4f67c6687bd29838abfcf.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.\u00a0Yum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/8da7d427a58156422343f447ece5780b.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/740daad8a97062c4fea0695a05ec3233.avif?t=1763559788\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The food must be delicious and, most importantly, delivered on time, or prepare to throw hands with the gods themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.poster.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.webm?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/62579c0fa0aa9def80bebd6a13c4adf7.mp4?t=1763559788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/80cb2fb6ade9d8a9d610deabf646a9af.avif?t=1763559788\" width=1200 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Before40"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/745802012bc3d7ca53db5b21c96963a0e